Chapter: ItemNames

 Every ore draws as the same art, so the hue names the metal: ServUO Scripts/Misc/ResourceInfo.cs hues iron 0, copper
 0x96D and gold 0x8A5; UO has no silver ore, and 0x482 is UOX3's silver hue (its silver serpent, hue 1154). The 1.25
 client has no movable sand art (0x35F6-0x3601 are statics), so sand (item 104) draws as the ore pile in HUES.MUL hue
 0x15F, whose middle colour is (184, 168, 128).
  item-ore-hue : Integer -> Integer
  item-ore-hue (item) = if item == 6 then #08A5 else if item == 63 then #096D else if item == 64 then #0482 else if item == 104 then #015F else 0
 Ingots draw as the 1.25 client's own art per metal, the fourth tile of each six-tile TILEDATA family (0x1BE3 copper,
 0x1BE9 gold, 0x1BEF iron, 0x1BF5 silver), each flagged Generic (0x800) so the client stacks it: iron 0x1BF2, gold
 0x1BEC, copper 0x1BE6, silver 0x1BF8.
  item-ingot-art : Integer -> Integer
  item-ingot-art (item) = if item == 31 then #1BF2 else if item == 32 then #1BEC else if item == 65 then #1BE6 else if item == 66 then #1BF8 else 0
  item-ore-name : Integer -> Text
  item-ore-name (hue) = if hue == #08A5 then "gold ore" else if hue == #096D then "copper ore" else if hue == #0482 then "silver ore" else if hue == #015F then "sand" else ""
  item-art-name : Integer -> Text
  item-art-name (g) = if g == #0E75 then "backpack" else if g == #0E76 then "bag" else if g == #09B2 then "bank box"
    else if g == #1517 then "shirt" else if g == #152E then "pants" else if g == #170F then "shoes"
    else if g == #0E86 then "pickaxe" else if g == #0F39 then "shovel" else if g == #0F43 then "hatchet" else if g == #0F49 then "axe"
    else if g == #0EC4 then "skinning knife" else if g == #0F52 then "dagger" else if g == #13E3 then "smith's hammer"
    else if g == #1034 then "saw" else if g == #1EB8 then "tinker's tools" else if g == #0F9D then "sewing kit"
    else if g == #0F9F then "scissors" else if g == #0E9B then "mortar and pestle" else if g == #0FBF then "pen and ink"
    else if g == #1022 then "fletcher's tools" else if g == #0DC0 then "fishing pole" else if g == #1043 then "rolling pin"
    else if g == #097F then "skillet" else if g == #0FA9 then "dyes" else if g == #0FAB then "dye tub"
    else if g == #14FC then "lockpick" else if g == #0EB2 then "lap harp" else if g == #1B76 then "heater shield"
    else if g == #0EB3 then "lute" else if g == #0E9D then "tambourine" else if g == #14EC then "blank map" else if g == #0F0E then "empty bottle"
    else if g == #0F7A then "black pearl" else if g == #0F7B then "blood moss" else if g == #0F84 then "garlic"
    else if g == #0F85 then "ginseng" else if g == #0F86 then "mandrake root" else if g == #0F88 then "nightshade"
    else if g == #0F8D then "spider's silk" else if g == #0F8C then "sulfurous ash" else if g == #0F8F then "grave dust"
    else if g == #1BF2 then "ingots" else if g == #1BEC then "gold ingots" else if g == #1BE6 then "copper ingots" else if g == #1BF8 then "silver ingots" else if g == #1BDD then "logs" else if g == #1BD7 then "boards"
    else if g == #1766 then "cloth" else if g == #1081 then "leather" else if g == #0DF9 then "cotton" else if g == #1BD1 then "feathers"
    else if g == #0EFA then "spellbook" else if g == #1F14 then "recall rune" else if g == #0EF3 then "blank scroll"
    else if g == #0EED then "gold coins" else if g == #0F6C then "moongate" else if g == #0F81 then "clay" else ""
